Triqo
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
REAKU 8 FACE_ALL
REAKU 5 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE_STACK REAKU REAKU
OR
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DEST Empty
    AND
        SRCSTACK Suit match
        DEST Size >= 6
$win
AND
    AND
        PILE ALL REAKU Empty
        PILE ALL REAKU Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL REAKU Empty
        PILE ALL REAKU Empty
